WEBVTT

00:14.070 --> 00:17.010
♪Tear up all the memories of the past♪

00:18.200 --> 00:20.850
♪Let go of all regrets♪

00:20.850 --> 00:26.260
♪I exchange my whole life for a change♪

00:27.730 --> 00:31.280
♪If I decide to let my guard down♪

00:31.830 --> 00:36.120
♪Will I fall for the wrong one♪

00:37.080 --> 00:40.630
♪I dare to give
without fear of destruction♪

00:41.620 --> 00:43.830
♪Love refuses to fall asleep♪

00:43.830 --> 00:46.870
♪I dare to shake heaven and earth♪

00:46.870 --> 00:48.950
♪Even with different paths and goals♪

00:48.950 --> 00:53.010
♪I have no regrets♪

00:53.520 --> 00:58.290
♪Because you're
an unsolvable riddle by fate♪

00:58.290 --> 01:02.580
♪I pray for a miracle♪

01:02.580 --> 01:03.990
♪Over the time♪

01:03.990 --> 01:06.000
♪Even if I'm burned out♪

01:06.000 --> 01:08.850
♪I'm willing to search for the miracle♪

01:08.850 --> 01:12.120
♪Of being with you forever♪

01:12.120 --> 01:16.820
♪I will travel with you all the way♪

01:17.520 --> 01:25.170
♪Love is the most beautiful in life♪

01:37.840 --> 01:43.200
=Sword and Fairy=

01:43.400 --> 01:46.729
=Episode 24=

01:47.180 --> 01:49.289
(Luo Mansion)

02:29.360 --> 02:30.590
I sensed it.

02:30.680 --> 02:33.120
The Luo family indeed
has the hole of spring.

02:34.550 --> 02:36.680
Please excuse my manners.

02:37.280 --> 02:39.000
I wonder why you have come.

02:39.550 --> 02:40.360
Don't play dumb.

02:40.640 --> 02:42.190
Hand over the key ring of Rehai.

02:42.960 --> 02:43.550
Alright then.

02:45.030 --> 02:46.160
I will if you can touch it.

02:47.160 --> 02:48.440
Big talk!

04:05.570 --> 04:06.090
Your Lordship.

04:09.250 --> 04:11.370
(He can block Her Lordship's attack!)

04:14.330 --> 04:15.370
Within the territory of Rehai,

04:16.170 --> 04:17.730
no one can harm me.

04:18.529 --> 04:20.450
The key ring of Rehai
is a treasure of the Six Realms

04:20.570 --> 04:21.649
and is super valuable.

04:21.970 --> 04:24.210
How would I possibly hand it over?

04:28.730 --> 04:29.490
Here comes the one

04:31.890 --> 04:33.250
who's meant to come.

04:42.640 --> 04:43.340
Mr. Ying,

04:43.340 --> 04:44.970
you are very well informed.

04:45.409 --> 04:46.409
We've just arrived,

04:47.130 --> 04:48.130
and you came immediately.

04:49.650 --> 04:50.890
It concerns Rehai.

04:51.450 --> 04:52.490
I had to come.

04:53.330 --> 04:55.610
Mr. Ying, I've heard a lot about you.

04:56.370 --> 04:57.570
You've all come from afar.

04:58.010 --> 04:59.250
Tea has been prepared.

04:59.890 --> 05:00.770
Please follow me.

05:32.610 --> 05:33.010
How is it?

05:33.370 --> 05:34.570
Any news on Lang Mo?

05:36.240 --> 05:37.450
(Lang Mo is in the Mangwan Village.)

05:38.610 --> 05:39.850
We only know he is in a village

05:40.090 --> 05:41.810
called Mangwan in the Western Regions.

05:42.770 --> 05:44.730
No other news for now.

05:45.170 --> 05:45.930
We must not delay.

05:46.130 --> 05:48.090
Let's change our course
to the Mangwan Village.

05:48.450 --> 05:48.970
Xiu,

05:50.530 --> 05:51.409
go back to Mount Yuqing

05:52.090 --> 05:53.250
to hold vigil for Hanjiang.

05:54.409 --> 05:55.890
Leave the matters of the village to us.

05:56.610 --> 05:57.290
Rest assured.

05:59.130 --> 05:59.610
Okay.

06:00.410 --> 06:01.410
I'll stay with him.

06:02.170 --> 06:03.970
Me, and me too.

06:04.210 --> 06:06.210
I'll stay to keep Miss Ming company.

06:06.290 --> 06:06.770
Besides...

06:08.290 --> 06:08.890
Besides...

06:09.890 --> 06:11.410
I want to hold vigil for Mr. Gu too.

06:11.530 --> 06:12.210
- Good.
- No need.

06:15.130 --> 06:15.610
Shifang,

06:16.610 --> 06:17.730
if Xiu gets angry,

06:18.010 --> 06:18.890
say nice things to her.

06:20.130 --> 06:21.410
If she is unhappy and hits you,

06:21.930 --> 06:22.690
you take it.

06:26.610 --> 06:27.170
My punches

06:28.290 --> 06:29.130
really hurt.

06:30.050 --> 06:31.530
I'm tough. I'm not afraid.

06:34.090 --> 06:35.450
You're really grown up.

06:36.610 --> 06:37.570
I'm happy

06:38.650 --> 06:39.490
and yet somewhat sad.

06:49.010 --> 06:50.970
Mr. Ju and I will ride Lingxiao there.

06:51.530 --> 06:53.409
You keep the Yunlai Stone.

06:54.490 --> 06:55.250
If anything happens,

06:57.210 --> 06:58.210
send a paper crane to me.

07:00.170 --> 07:00.650
Well...

07:03.730 --> 07:06.090
It doesn't matter who keeps it.

07:06.530 --> 07:07.250
We're family.

07:11.450 --> 07:11.890
Okay.

07:15.610 --> 07:17.770
Now that we're done saying goodbye,

07:18.450 --> 07:20.170
I'll go tell Jinzhao and Little Yue

07:20.530 --> 07:22.210
we're setting off.

07:36.140 --> 07:38.800
♪If I trek
through the long river of memory♪

07:39.720 --> 07:42.990
♪What will I pick up♪

07:42.990 --> 07:47.650
♪Is it joy from the past years
or piercing pain♪

07:50.510 --> 07:53.230
♪What did I hear♪

07:53.930 --> 07:57.450
♪Laughter from the Milky Way♪

07:57.770 --> 08:02.320
♪My heartbeat remembers it. Who are you♪

08:04.680 --> 08:08.330
(Gu Hanjiang's Tomb)
♪I can't grasp the fleeting joy♪

08:08.330 --> 08:11.370
♪I can't have you by my side♪

08:11.370 --> 08:14.570
♪I have to come to terms
with my regrets♪

08:15.810 --> 08:16.490
(Master,)

08:17.730 --> 08:18.890
(after the funeral custom,)

08:19.570 --> 08:20.530
(I will go to them.)

08:22.650 --> 08:24.210
(They helped me without reserve.)

08:26.010 --> 08:26.930
(I want to help them too.)

08:27.690 --> 08:31.310
♪I stole the answer
to the riddle from destiny♪

08:31.310 --> 08:34.960
♪Can it exchange for your stay♪

08:34.960 --> 08:38.539
♪I had you in my grasp, but I lost you♪

08:38.539 --> 08:41.840
♪Thus reunion took on a new meaning♪

08:47.630 --> 08:50.590
(Mangwan Village)

08:59.410 --> 09:00.810
This is the Xiangzhen Forest.

09:03.410 --> 09:04.170
Beyond the woods,

09:04.170 --> 09:05.210
there's a village up ahead.

09:06.010 --> 09:07.250
It must be the Mangwan Village.

09:12.370 --> 09:13.850
Jinzhao, what is this?

09:13.970 --> 09:14.930
How can you see so far?

09:16.610 --> 09:17.530
This is a spyglass.

09:18.480 --> 09:20.360
It's made according to ancient designs.

09:20.810 --> 09:21.330
Have a go.

09:24.890 --> 09:26.210
I can't see anything at all.

09:26.930 --> 09:27.810
You need to twist it.

09:28.490 --> 09:29.450
Then it becomes clearer.

09:29.900 --> 09:31.410
I see it!

09:32.620 --> 09:33.890
I really can see very far.

09:33.890 --> 09:34.410
You like it?

09:37.410 --> 09:39.330
The device made
by Shifang is very exquisite.

09:41.890 --> 09:42.690
When we go back,

09:43.330 --> 09:44.570
I'll ask Shifang to make one for you.

09:54.210 --> 09:55.370
Look, Jinzhao.

09:55.530 --> 09:56.330
Isn't that Lang Mo?

10:00.170 --> 10:01.850
Yes, it's really Lang Mo.

10:02.130 --> 10:02.490
Let's go.

11:11.810 --> 11:12.650
You really came.

11:24.770 --> 11:25.210
Luo Maiming,

11:26.010 --> 11:27.530
hand over the key ring of Rehai now!

11:32.210 --> 11:34.490
I can hand it over,

11:36.890 --> 11:37.690
but

11:38.610 --> 11:40.650
I want to see who makes the offer

11:40.770 --> 11:42.610
that aligns more with my desire.

11:46.690 --> 11:47.410
What I want

11:48.930 --> 11:52.050
is the method to lift
the Rehai Bloodbinding.

11:53.130 --> 11:54.450
Do either of you have it?

11:55.770 --> 11:56.490
I don't have it.

11:58.250 --> 11:58.930
He does.

12:02.890 --> 12:03.970
I do have it.

12:07.450 --> 12:09.770
But why should I tell you?

12:10.810 --> 12:11.610
Ying Xuwei,

12:13.410 --> 12:16.370
Mist Soul is still in the Core
of the Demon Realm.

12:22.970 --> 12:23.650
Since

12:24.730 --> 12:26.850
I won't be told the method
to lift Bloodbinding,

12:28.410 --> 12:30.010
I'll hand over Rehai

12:30.010 --> 12:31.090
to Her Lordship

12:32.050 --> 12:34.330
so Her Lordship can absorb it at will.
How about that?

12:40.450 --> 12:41.130
Mr. Luo,

12:43.330 --> 12:44.970
are you threatening me?

12:46.050 --> 12:46.730
How could I?

12:48.650 --> 12:51.490
I just want you to stay

12:52.290 --> 12:54.290
so we will have a good discussion.

12:55.410 --> 12:58.450
Once a large amount of energy
is drained from the hole of spring,

12:58.650 --> 13:00.490
it'll inevitably threaten
the Six Realms.

13:02.690 --> 13:05.050
We've all got people
we care about in this world,

13:05.690 --> 13:08.210
and none of us want
to see such things happen.

13:11.490 --> 13:12.730
I can tell you

13:13.850 --> 13:15.690
the unbinding method,

13:16.930 --> 13:18.170
but my condition is

13:18.810 --> 13:21.490
that I'll keep

13:21.650 --> 13:23.090
the key ring of Rehai later.

13:27.090 --> 13:27.810
I agree.

13:31.210 --> 13:33.770
The day the Bloodbinding
is successfully lifted,

13:34.490 --> 13:38.330
I will personally present
the key ring to you, Mr. Ying.

14:10.810 --> 14:11.770
It's you guys who saved me.

14:12.570 --> 14:13.410
Sorry about that.

14:16.730 --> 14:17.250
You are

14:18.010 --> 14:18.730
Master Luo!

14:20.170 --> 14:20.690
Yes.

14:21.730 --> 14:23.970
Previously, due to some reasons,

14:24.170 --> 14:26.050
I had to disguise as a man.

14:28.090 --> 14:28.650
Lang Mo,

14:29.330 --> 14:31.290
were you hunting for prey just now?

14:31.890 --> 14:32.330
Correct.

14:32.850 --> 14:33.850
I'm looking for a demon beast.

14:37.090 --> 14:38.770
Others shun demon beasts at all costs.

14:39.210 --> 14:40.410
Why do you seek it out on purpose?

14:47.770 --> 14:48.970
It's a long story.

14:50.890 --> 14:51.930
Before, in the Luori Village,

14:52.410 --> 14:55.490
Master Luo used the treasures
seized from the Qiyuan Sect

14:55.610 --> 14:57.290
as our travel money back home.

14:57.890 --> 14:59.170
I saw a beautiful bead,

15:00.250 --> 15:01.050
so I brought it back

15:01.810 --> 15:03.490
for my wife, Yu Xiang.

15:06.450 --> 15:07.130
It's so pretty.

15:13.090 --> 15:13.770
Put it on me.

15:22.570 --> 15:23.210
It's truly lovely.

15:24.530 --> 15:26.330
But who would know
after Yu Xiang put it on,

15:27.170 --> 15:27.890
the Qiyuan Orb

15:28.410 --> 15:30.010
fused into her body?

15:37.170 --> 15:38.050
Ever since then,

15:39.450 --> 15:42.570
she's been getting weaker and weaker.

15:46.650 --> 15:47.370
I seek demon beasts,

15:48.570 --> 15:50.250
hoping to get a demon beast's inner orb

15:50.690 --> 15:51.690
to prolong Yu Xiang's life.

15:55.050 --> 15:55.810
The Qiyuan Orb.

15:56.730 --> 15:57.330
That's right.

15:59.170 --> 16:00.970
Are you here for the Qiyuan Orb?

16:01.210 --> 16:02.090
Then do you know

16:02.450 --> 16:03.330
the method to remove it?

16:09.370 --> 16:10.170
Could you take us

16:10.490 --> 16:12.090
to take a look at her?

16:13.730 --> 16:14.330
This way, please.

16:20.410 --> 16:21.130
Zhu Yu.

16:25.890 --> 16:27.370
You've got plenty of Qiyuan Orbs.

16:27.850 --> 16:30.330
Why insist on obtaining Rehai?

16:30.770 --> 16:32.170
The Qiyuan Orbs come from humans.

16:32.810 --> 16:36.090
The Vitality Energy in them
is imbued with humans' dark emotions,

16:36.210 --> 16:37.890
far less pure than that of Rehai.

16:38.490 --> 16:39.330
Nowadays,

16:40.370 --> 16:42.370
I often feel like a stranger to myself.

16:43.210 --> 16:45.890
Healing my clan before I lose my sanity

16:46.090 --> 16:49.130
is the most prudent way I can think of.

16:50.650 --> 16:53.850
Taking your clan into the time stasis

16:54.050 --> 16:55.890
is the most prudent way.

16:56.290 --> 16:57.570
That's just sacrificing our clan

16:57.850 --> 16:59.410
in exchange for what you call safety.

16:59.610 --> 17:00.410
How is that prudent?

17:02.330 --> 17:04.050
You're afraid you can't control me.

17:08.609 --> 17:10.050
You've decided
to use my daughter to scheme

17:10.690 --> 17:12.530
against me, haven't you?

17:13.690 --> 17:14.480
When the time comes,

17:15.290 --> 17:17.130
even if I lose my sanity,

17:17.890 --> 17:19.530
what will you be afraid of?

17:25.040 --> 17:32.240
(Luo's Residence)

17:34.410 --> 17:35.290
This way, please.

17:48.490 --> 17:49.130
Yu Xiang.

17:52.930 --> 17:54.810
Yu Xiang.

17:55.610 --> 17:56.370
Do you still remember

17:56.610 --> 17:57.370
Master Luo,

17:57.530 --> 17:58.810
the one who saved us?

17:59.130 --> 17:59.690
She's here.

18:00.570 --> 18:01.090
Yu Xiang.

18:03.970 --> 18:04.570
Yu Xiang.

18:14.490 --> 18:15.650
She's been like this for so long,

18:16.330 --> 18:17.890
subsisting on the herbs I gather

18:18.530 --> 18:19.050
and also

18:19.370 --> 18:21.210
the inner orbs of demon beasts I hunt.

18:30.570 --> 18:31.170
It's all my fault.

18:31.890 --> 18:33.090
It's all because of me

18:35.010 --> 18:36.810
that Yu Xiang ended up like this.

18:38.930 --> 18:39.570
Sir,

18:40.090 --> 18:41.290
please save her.

18:44.890 --> 18:46.610
Jinzhao, they are so pitiful.

18:54.090 --> 18:55.450
Let's save her.

18:55.810 --> 18:58.050
We will, but not now.

19:09.890 --> 19:10.450
I'm sorry.

19:11.850 --> 19:12.890
She's beyond help.

19:22.410 --> 19:23.530
She can't be saved?

19:24.970 --> 19:26.450
Not even you can save her?

19:31.010 --> 19:31.570
Yu Xiang.

19:33.450 --> 19:34.130
I'm sorry, Lang Mo.

19:34.970 --> 19:37.250
If I had found
this Qiyuan Orb that day...

19:37.370 --> 19:37.890
Zhaoyan,

19:39.130 --> 19:39.890
don't blame yourself.

19:40.330 --> 19:41.210
Don't, Zhaoyan.

19:41.690 --> 19:42.850
It's not your fault.

19:51.450 --> 19:52.450
Could you please leave?

19:53.890 --> 19:55.330
I have to make medicine for Yu Xiang.

19:57.170 --> 19:57.690
Mr. Lang,

19:59.010 --> 19:59.890
may I ask you a question?

20:13.090 --> 20:13.770
Luohuan,

20:14.770 --> 20:16.770
why is there no movement
at all over there?

20:17.730 --> 20:20.210
Will Lang Mo really make a move on them?

20:21.210 --> 20:23.330
For his wife, he will.

20:27.490 --> 20:29.450
This time,
thanks to Qingfei's persuasion,

20:29.730 --> 20:31.850
Xuwei allowed the two of us
to monitor him together.

20:32.410 --> 20:33.850
Otherwise, it'd be so boring
for you alone.

20:35.050 --> 20:36.170
It's not just surveillance.

20:36.850 --> 20:37.770
I know.

20:37.930 --> 20:39.450
We'll also snatch them to the Yujie Hub.

20:40.130 --> 20:40.890
But Luohuan,

20:41.810 --> 20:42.370
why do we

20:42.450 --> 20:44.530
suddenly have to snatch them up?

20:46.410 --> 20:46.970
Xiaoyuan,

20:47.770 --> 20:48.330
do you know

20:49.090 --> 20:50.970
we're not doing good things?

20:51.610 --> 20:52.490
I know.

20:53.010 --> 20:53.930
So what?

20:54.370 --> 20:56.170
No matter what you guys do, I'll help.

20:59.090 --> 21:00.090
Why did you hit me again?

21:00.970 --> 21:02.850
Precisely because we are
not doing good deeds

21:02.970 --> 21:04.210
but you don't care.

21:04.730 --> 21:05.890
This is what Xuwei,

21:06.250 --> 21:07.970
Qingfei and I least want to see.

21:08.610 --> 21:10.290
Although we're doing bad things,

21:10.410 --> 21:12.050
it is to protect the Six Realms.

21:12.370 --> 21:13.130
How awesome!

21:16.410 --> 21:17.010
Xiaoyuan,

21:18.090 --> 21:19.330
no matter what,

21:19.770 --> 21:21.090
doing evil

21:21.730 --> 21:22.770
is wrong.

21:24.210 --> 21:26.210
We shouldn't feel superior.

21:26.810 --> 21:28.570
Sacrificing so many innocent people

21:28.890 --> 21:30.410
to achieve what we believe,

21:31.250 --> 21:32.930
we're the ones to be condemned.

21:34.650 --> 21:35.730
But it doesn't concern you.

21:36.290 --> 21:37.330
When we return,

21:37.610 --> 21:39.090
I'll let Xuwei give you
a good lesson again.

21:39.250 --> 21:40.050
I don't want that.

21:41.890 --> 21:43.010
And this? Do you want it?

21:49.170 --> 21:50.210
I want a butterfly.

21:50.530 --> 21:51.690
It's prettier.

21:52.770 --> 21:54.050
Picky.

22:02.650 --> 22:03.290
Lang Mo,

22:04.450 --> 22:05.090
my condolences.

22:06.280 --> 22:07.530
It will pass.

22:08.930 --> 22:09.650
Where are you going?

22:11.290 --> 22:13.090
There is a grassland
in front of the village.

22:15.290 --> 22:16.170
Yu Xiang used to

22:17.250 --> 22:18.850
spend a lot of time there
looking at the scenery.

22:25.130 --> 22:25.730
Let's go.

22:35.730 --> 22:37.770
They're here. Let's go.

23:15.570 --> 23:16.330
Everyone,

23:17.090 --> 23:17.850
sorry about this.

23:22.130 --> 23:22.690
Qi.

23:26.170 --> 23:26.770
Qi.

23:34.090 --> 23:34.770
Come out.

23:40.570 --> 23:41.330
Bian Luohuan.

23:43.210 --> 23:44.200
Luohuan, hurry up.

23:49.090 --> 23:50.410
The people you want are already here.

23:50.650 --> 23:51.890
How do I remove the Qiyuan Orb?

23:52.940 --> 23:53.810
I'll help you with it.

24:16.410 --> 24:17.210
Luohuan, watch out!

24:29.730 --> 24:31.530
It seems
that Lang Mo has already told you.

24:32.530 --> 24:33.730
How can you go back on your word?

24:37.130 --> 24:37.530
Mr. Lang,

24:38.770 --> 24:39.770
may I ask you a question?

24:43.930 --> 24:45.930
How did you know
it was called the Qiyuan Orb?

24:47.170 --> 24:47.730
That's right.

24:48.650 --> 24:49.930
This is a remote place.

24:50.810 --> 24:51.970
How did you know of it?

24:53.530 --> 24:54.930
And at that time you said,

24:55.250 --> 24:56.250
"You really came."

24:57.010 --> 24:58.650
Later you mentioned the Qiyuan Orb.

24:59.050 --> 25:01.930
Seems someone from the Qiyuan Sect
had told you earlier

25:02.450 --> 25:03.330
we would come.

25:05.130 --> 25:05.890
Well...

25:07.770 --> 25:09.210
Their headquarters have been destroyed.

25:09.650 --> 25:11.090
What's left
are just some sorry stragglers.

25:11.610 --> 25:14.050
It's unlikely for them
to spread to this place.

25:15.530 --> 25:16.850
Is it Bian Luohuan and his cohorts?

25:18.490 --> 25:19.170
Is it or not?

25:23.850 --> 25:25.050
You all have saved my life.

25:26.010 --> 25:27.090
I'm very grateful.

25:28.970 --> 25:30.490
But this concerns the life of Yu Xiang.

25:30.610 --> 25:31.850
We know how to remove the Qiyuan Orb.

25:36.130 --> 25:36.770
Really?

25:38.370 --> 25:39.410
But didn't you just say

25:40.130 --> 25:40.970
she couldn't be saved?

25:42.170 --> 25:43.010
Let me try

25:43.290 --> 25:44.730
and you'll know.

26:23.210 --> 26:23.850
Yu Xiang.

26:26.770 --> 26:29.250
I-I-It's really been taken out.

26:32.970 --> 26:34.730
Mr. Lang,

26:35.450 --> 26:37.210
we need you to help us put on a play.

26:43.250 --> 26:44.770
Luohuan, stop wasting words with them.

26:44.890 --> 26:45.890
Just grab them and go.

27:14.250 --> 27:14.690
Yu Xiang.

27:15.130 --> 27:15.810
Lang Mo.

27:40.010 --> 27:41.010
It's all your fault.

27:41.690 --> 27:42.170
Run.

27:55.010 --> 27:56.730
What were you sneaking around
for just now?

28:02.490 --> 28:03.210
Forget it.

28:04.210 --> 28:05.530
You'd just lie even if I asked.

28:08.010 --> 28:09.250
You've remembered it all.

28:11.090 --> 28:12.250
When you were at the Fengyan Inn,

28:13.170 --> 28:14.490
I asked you if you were my master,

28:15.250 --> 28:15.970
but you denied it.

28:17.170 --> 28:17.850
I'm sorry.

28:19.810 --> 28:21.370
I couldn't tell you at the time.

28:24.010 --> 28:25.210
How about in the Luori Village?

28:27.290 --> 28:28.010
At the Luo's.

28:29.330 --> 28:30.130
Jing'an.

28:31.130 --> 28:32.130
Qiyuan's headquarters.

28:34.450 --> 28:36.130
You had so many chances

28:37.450 --> 28:39.130
but you never planned to tell me.

28:41.290 --> 28:42.050
Even now,

28:43.210 --> 28:44.570
you're still hiding it from me.

28:50.690 --> 28:51.410
I...

29:06.090 --> 29:06.970
You were

29:08.250 --> 29:09.170
drugging me?

29:16.610 --> 29:17.330
Jinzhao.

29:42.170 --> 29:42.770
(Oh, no.)

29:43.650 --> 29:44.930
(I've got no strength left.)

29:48.210 --> 29:48.850
Come on.

29:50.330 --> 29:51.170
Come here.

29:51.930 --> 29:52.810
Let's keep fighting.

29:55.930 --> 29:57.050
Don't use your inner strength,

29:57.730 --> 29:59.490
or you'll risk a backlash.

30:05.730 --> 30:06.490
Let go of me.

30:14.450 --> 30:15.050
Jinzhao.

30:21.490 --> 30:22.130
Jinzhao!

30:35.050 --> 30:35.770
You wanna die?

30:42.730 --> 30:43.500
Jinzhao!

31:15.370 --> 31:16.210
Qi.

31:31.570 --> 31:32.170
Luohuan!

31:34.170 --> 31:34.730
Qi.

31:39.930 --> 31:40.620
Luohuan.

31:41.490 --> 31:42.220
Luohuan!

31:45.380 --> 31:46.060
Qi.

31:47.220 --> 31:47.780
Luohuan.

31:48.500 --> 31:49.140
Luohuan.

31:49.580 --> 31:50.580
Luohuan, are you alright?

31:51.100 --> 31:51.780
Luohuan.

31:52.520 --> 31:53.290
Luohuan.

31:53.580 --> 31:55.540
I'll go avenge you.

31:55.660 --> 31:56.220
Xiaoyuan,

31:57.220 --> 31:59.980
take Yue Jinzhao and Yue Qi away

32:00.620 --> 32:01.740
and don't hurt them.

32:05.090 --> 32:05.810
Luohuan.

32:06.450 --> 32:07.290
Luohuan!

32:08.200 --> 32:09.130
(No other choice.)

32:13.470 --> 32:14.270
Xian Qing.

32:15.110 --> 32:15.790
Xian Qing!

32:20.950 --> 32:21.870
You, and you,

32:21.990 --> 32:22.710
come with me.

32:33.190 --> 32:34.950
What, looking for a beating?

32:35.230 --> 32:36.550
If you take one more step forward,

32:36.750 --> 32:37.710
I will kill him.

32:39.030 --> 32:40.990
You want to bring back a dead man now

32:41.430 --> 32:43.590
or to capture a live one later?

32:43.750 --> 32:44.750
It's up to you.

32:44.870 --> 32:45.430
You're lying.

32:45.750 --> 32:47.110
Aren't you friends?

32:48.990 --> 32:49.960
I am a demon.

32:50.710 --> 32:52.550
You want to see if a demon thinks

32:52.710 --> 32:53.950
like a human?

33:01.910 --> 33:02.890
Make your decision.

33:04.030 --> 33:05.190
Bian Luohuan might not hold on

33:05.750 --> 33:07.310
much longer with his injuries.

33:08.470 --> 33:09.740
Darn you!

33:37.110 --> 33:37.710
Qi.

34:10.989 --> 34:11.710
Qi.

34:15.070 --> 34:15.710
Qi.

34:16.710 --> 34:17.389
Qi.

34:42.550 --> 34:43.150
Xian Qing.

34:45.989 --> 34:47.590
We will return
to Mount Yuqing immediately.

34:59.630 --> 35:00.360
Master Luo.

35:06.110 --> 35:07.050
Thank you

35:08.350 --> 35:10.310
for saving Yu Xiang today.

35:19.510 --> 35:20.990
Though it's not a panacea,

35:21.550 --> 35:22.990
I hope it can help him

35:23.070 --> 35:24.230
ease the pain a little.

35:26.310 --> 35:26.950
Thank you.

36:38.190 --> 36:39.190
Has Yue woken up?

36:39.750 --> 36:40.670
Still unconscious.

36:44.030 --> 36:44.870
What's on your mind?

36:46.990 --> 36:47.670
I am thinking,

36:48.390 --> 36:49.390
our visit to that village

36:49.390 --> 36:50.510
was completely impromptu.

36:51.310 --> 36:53.590
How did Bian Luohuan learn about it?

36:55.590 --> 36:56.310
You got any ideas?

36:58.470 --> 36:59.310
I asked the disciples

36:59.670 --> 37:01.950
of my family to secretly investigate
Lang Mo's whereabouts.

37:02.150 --> 37:03.470
Only one can access the report.

37:06.070 --> 37:06.710
It's Maiming.

37:11.470 --> 37:12.310
So you suspect

37:13.030 --> 37:14.950
it was Luo Maiming
who informed Bian Luohuan?

37:18.630 --> 37:19.390
I do not know.

37:20.990 --> 37:22.830
I thought I knew Maiming very well,

37:23.590 --> 37:24.750
but now I realize

37:26.790 --> 37:28.870
I don't really know him.

37:30.310 --> 37:31.110
Let's go to your house

37:33.390 --> 37:35.070
and figure out everything.

37:36.270 --> 37:38.190
Bian Luohuan took Qi back
to the Yujie Hub.

37:38.990 --> 37:41.190
If Luo Maiming is truly
in cahoots with Bian Luohuan,

37:41.310 --> 37:43.510
perhaps he knows where the Yujie Hub is.

37:47.910 --> 37:49.150
You might not know it.

37:49.710 --> 37:51.830
Maiming can take the energy
of Rehai for his own use.

37:51.990 --> 37:52.990
Then within the territory

37:53.110 --> 37:54.150
of Rehai, no one can beat him.

37:55.510 --> 37:56.230
What of it?

37:57.470 --> 37:58.670
No matter how tough it gets,

37:59.310 --> 38:00.630
I'm determined to find Qi.

38:20.350 --> 38:23.460
♪Looking back♪

38:24.350 --> 38:27.200
♪I try to bring back memories♪

38:28.220 --> 38:32.220
♪We're connected♪

38:32.450 --> 38:34.560
♪It's meant to be♪

38:36.250 --> 38:39.400
♪I've fallen in love silently♪

38:40.480 --> 38:43.450
♪Years leave no trace behind♪

38:44.190 --> 38:46.370
♪On a moonlight night♪

38:46.370 --> 38:48.190
♪I lapsed into my memories♪

38:48.450 --> 38:50.590
♪About you♪

38:51.130 --> 38:54.370
♪All laughter and joy are about you♪

38:55.130 --> 38:58.450
♪It's unforgettable. It's all about you♪

38:59.100 --> 39:00.960
♪The past glided before my mind♪

39:00.960 --> 39:03.200
♪I smiled and cried♪

39:03.200 --> 39:07.930
♪For happiness♪

39:08.450 --> 39:12.160
♪I went about the world looking for you♪

39:12.450 --> 39:16.380
♪All I have was the echo in the valley♪

39:16.380 --> 39:18.400
♪In this tranquil world♪

39:18.400 --> 39:20.380
♪I've finally found you♪

39:20.380 --> 39:24.480
♪I'll spend the rest
of my life with you♪

39:24.480 --> 39:28.250
♪I've been looking for you♪

39:28.250 --> 39:32.510
♪I wish to share joy
and sorrow with you♪

39:33.250 --> 39:34.750
♪Among the vast sea of people♪

39:34.750 --> 39:36.960
♪I engrave your name♪

39:36.960 --> 39:43.290
♪Believe me, you're the only one♪

39:58.430 --> 40:01.420
♪Wind rises and rain ceases♪

40:02.460 --> 40:05.400
♪During the long-lost quiet time♪

40:06.430 --> 40:10.300
♪Both of us get closer♪

40:10.300 --> 40:12.450
♪And watch the stars♪

40:14.240 --> 40:17.360
♪I've fallen in love silently♪

